---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy | KK Coaching"
  description="How KK Coaching collects, uses and protects your personal data."
  lang="en"
  path="/privacy"
  altPath="/pl/privacy"
>
  <section class="legal-page">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="notice">
        <strong>Placeholder content.</strong> This page is a structural template only.
        Replace every section below with wording reviewed against UK GDPR / Data Protection Act 2018
        before publishing. Do not launch with lorem ipsum legal text.
      </p>

      <h2>1. Who we are</h2>
      <p>Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. KK Coaching, [business address to be confirmed], is the data controller for this website.</p>

      <h2>2. What data we collect</h2>
      <p>Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet: name, email, phone number, location, coaching interest, and any goals or context you share via the contact form.</p>

      <h2>3. Why we collect it</h2>
      <p>Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit, to respond to enquiries and provide coaching services you have requested.</p>

      <h2>4. How long we keep it</h2>
      <p>Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet - retention period to be defined.</p>

      <h2>5. Your rights</h2>
      <p>Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet - access, rectification, erasure, and how to exercise these rights.</p>

      <h2>6. Cookies</h2>
      <p>See our <a href="/cookies">Cookie Policy</a> for details on analytics cookies and consent.</p>

      <h2>7. Contact</h2>
      <p>Questions about this policy: [contact email to be confirmed].</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .legal-page { padding: 72px 0; }
  .legal-page .container { max-width: 760px; }
  .legal-page h1 { font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 3.2vw, 2.4rem); margin-bottom: 20px; }
  .legal-page h2 { font-size: 1.2rem; margin-top: 32px; margin-bottom: 10px; }
  .legal-page p { color: var(--steel); }
  .notice {
    background: #FBEAEA;
    border-left: 3px solid var(--red);
    padding: 14px 18px;
    color: var(--graphite);
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }
</style>
